  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1702.01 Requests. A person may request a copy of the International Registration Plan by going to the following page: INTERNATIONAL REGISTRATION PLAN © (ymaws.com) or by contacting the department at the following address:\n\nDepartment of Safety\n\nATTN: Road Toll Administration\n\n33 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, NH 03305\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1700) #13379, EXEMPT, eff 5-23-22",
